@comment{
  HOW TO ADD A PUBLICATION
  1. Copy one of the entry blocks below (a whole block, first line through its closing brace).
  2. Paste it at the TOP of the list (papers are listed newest first).
  3. Give it a new unique citation key on the first line, e.g. kim2027topic.
  4. Edit the fields:
     - title    : the paper title.
     - author   : Last, First and Last, First. Your name (Kim, Yujin) is bolded automatically.
     - journal  : journal name (or booktitle for conference proceedings).
     - year, volume, number, pages : as applicable; delete any you do not have.
     - abbr     : short venue label shown as a tag, e.g. Pol. Comm. Optional.
     - selected : set to true to feature the paper on the homepage; remove the line to hide it.
     - doi      : keep this; the title links to it automatically.
  5. Save and push. Done.
}

